ac influence [Arabs]</desc></relation><relation active="http://syriaca.org/cbss/A2T45SJZ" ref="dc:subject"><desc>VI CE</desc></relation><relation active="http://syriaca.org/cbss/A2T45SJZ" ref="dc:subject"><desc>VII CE</desc></relation><relation active="http://syriaca.org/cbss/A2T45SJZ" ref="dc:subject"><desc>heterodoxy</desc></relation><relation active="http://syriaca.org/cbss/A2T45SJZ" ref="dc:subject"><desc>polemic</desc></relation></listRelation></body></text></TEI>